modal.explanation:
We don't have much information about the artistic team's tour. We therefore make a series of hypotheses:

- the artistic team is based in a location (the "artist base") at the center of all the tour's venues;

- without CooProg, the artistic team would return to its base after the performance(s) in each of the tour venues;

- with CooProg, we assume that the tour is sufficiently well coordinated that these round trips are replaced by direct journeys between tour venues.

If you wish to go further in estimating the real impact of this tour, you can use the mobility calculator integrated into the SEEDS tool by ARVIVA. [SEEDS by ARVIVA](http://seeds.arviva.org/).
